{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1254,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a52e1130ef49c3223a841d12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我得去买备用的矿泉水。\r\n因为我很纤细，\r\n所以对水非常讲究。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfc64e24cb128ff6dae99e34937d9870cc0df6daa45d3565763497b584523d90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d84e09159c183ffb8759fdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我约怒涛去并跑，结果她居然回\r\n「找我去好吗」。呵呵，就因为是她\r\n我才会邀约啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68836c0d94c83e5af5e6ba0b203b59e1b023cfb3ab7f5c57e777d3f7b53bb649",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72c5ad3790300d7d3e77a63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "某次我忽然察觉到，\r\n自己就是引领世界的「霸王」……\r\n我必须达成这个使命才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "984a04242fc38c298dec2a22dd510ad98683f79235f4e84c3b68e71489eec775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c2db339a95f957f95761713",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "织姬好像很喜欢星星，所以我\r\n送了一张照片给她，以便她随时都能\r\n眺望我这颗最明亮的一等星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c23990aac5996426e4e7bab76dc1fc21844cfa633a8df224251b284e3ff4cb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd0debdb9756a3f816fcd994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算违反宿舍规定，富士前辈也只会\r\n说一句「真是不听话的女孩」。\r\n……唔，在耀眼这方面我可不能输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dc0301ac0bd24474e5eb1d9aef700197ccbc1c15202be0a9575396288594bfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d699351e252f5041a5f2289b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是去参加什么演唱会，所有生物\r\n都会成为我的俘虏……啊啊，\r\n美丽过头的我真是太可怕了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca6051971a6cdec3a0f43dd5595c409ca45b581792bd9e9872c79403fe11d73c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7c261320c28f0a70883d79f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糟糕，我的光芒不能再继续\r\n增加下去了……！你也要当心一点，\r\n以免被闪瞎了双眼！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "958321fa1f42fec560cf182e7a25d70dd97ab1a6985c9767ea7a36fec02c19d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4698928185d825fd83eef7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈哈！\r\n这套决胜服正是我\r\n身为「霸王」的证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2701de217e0cb138a419d195410ee6e5c4b2d6139ec1a85382dfd1a5155f7c5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10c1df54b8ba9181c4a545fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抵达终点前那一瞬间的紧张……\r\n以及分出胜负后的欢呼声……\r\n光是想象我就涌出力量了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb8876d9af300760ba592798e24071241b7454d831880df5199bf09cfa3cfd75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03ecf676801ece93061108e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上总是像场战争……追求美丽的我\r\n以及和头发搏斗的晨光……\r\n我们都是很认真的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fce6b74a02317709cf7a8f35df4c6dd44b967ece3b4715114eb2965f36aac82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a7489b3047bc981de243559",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐时刻，数码她一直很热情地\r\n看着我……我应该很欢迎粉丝才对，\r\n但不知为何却觉得背脊发凉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce0305e184c1d92627fff968e9de3b0c37e759de2a5a2882afa7f823bfb77073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a4437d266adc2851ffc31e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会等最后一个才去洗澡。\r\n因为我想尽情享受水面上浮着玫瑰，\r\n同时优雅歌唱的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6c68e535c84efa59617fcb2ebb8582682a9be549d90e3d4d1f3b51fb261ab4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dc2dd1b76a353fa0f0cc819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节可以欣赏到\r\n我和花朵的交响乐。\r\n呵……相机准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6c5f4d7c79daaf76d11b6e9bcee83bd67523dd582d668611738a8dd9788b5ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec920b2a813a25bd0a5b8c71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……居然连蚊子\r\n都被我的魅力吸引而来……！\r\n我该感到高兴吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b6c0bab7fc1c01ab325d0950f8ba13e33155eeae9bc3c98dd4060bd025de13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55bd98561056c430d741d255",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "艺术之秋吗……嗯，我明白。\r\n你想绘制我的肖像画吧？\r\n没问题……尽管画！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b81445f98ca0c9e686a45241f1f8e892a5ff03793691ee28e4cd969d63e1228c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf7d32a48bae05039f0542be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是不会感冒的。\r\n因为我本人散发着光辉！\r\n感冒一靠近我就会消失了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd1b7ebf5f9b456e2a3418f5494a692ba9c61ffd771a04b9e91546a9c0d2b81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:100fe100ed4dddde86f56544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚我碰到织姬，\r\n她竟然不发一语把眼神移开！\r\n难道我耀眼到让她无法直视吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "260aa287b5ad4e32fd13d65d59b8e5de782792074908c106cd2878f731842aa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35e90b5cb494608eacae4f11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我请怒涛帮我拍了\r\n贺年卡要用的照片。\r\n于是我送了她签名照当谢礼喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f296015c3ddfc7cec13fedcfc7585da2f9301d7d7230ba1490aa810d54448d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31c914ec395fc5428c407571",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我传授了乌拉拉\r\n自己想到的「玫瑰姿势」。\r\n她非常认真地在练习喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73363af0ba3a8da38b0e2c6b20dbb25a9d82c9ef965e7823cabdb879ca81f89a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b30a2b308f7c64501869ae50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟福来一起去抽签，\r\n两个人都抽到大吉喔！\r\n没错，就连运势都迷恋着我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db5b25960a1f3837daddca51b51e55e4495c395657548b6aaff384253784d91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8184b905dc867807a0420b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在老家的时候，会在客厅举办\r\n新春公演。从暖炉桌登台的我\r\n表现得真是精彩……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d31921a22fcbc6f609556e4da5ab7e1e21433fceba0a3ed23870b553ab4df0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de7b974e4cf403c7caf375a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天虽然为了盛装打扮\r\n特意早起，但一照到镜子，\r\n睡意就全都烟消云散咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "531e7cc523ccffc7a30bb5cf82dff97a36df0a0958966bb2ff470b6086e4df98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2566e0a29afc46c536520efc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了！在下次的歌剧中，\r\n我就固定在风筝上，从空中登场好了！\r\n你现在就来陪我练习吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59eaf1678348a8890290e07e6c60cbc1aef13c49622666c4a1326d1544c53719",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c87f444368c38557de4a703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡前喝点甜酒怎么样？\r\n「全都是甜酒气泡的错！」这样笑着\r\n抛开今日烦忧，就能迎接愉快的明天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4eb48bb7632397eaa222291291bcf0a73c4e04f435d56beb1e9122ec3dd9b53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f2c026fa6c903ba6467a85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你那热切的眼神……\r\n是在怀念新年公演时的我吧……\r\n好，就来举办安可公演吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a06da02b66a7d7b398bca5149352c2177caf66d2aa5ab08cd513ba2c504acb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45c775e543c7362edf7577ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不能直接过去烟火大会耶。\r\n如果我在地面出现，\r\n夜空中的烟花就会相形失色……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad7d11e1bf4b1af0ee687899551092e39fd9479f2812a12f6b0ecf4082d09b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f80fd175effba7b2d672be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当我进行新春公演的练习时，\r\n落叶也沙沙土为我鼓掌喔！\r\n似乎是等不及新年的到来了呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74e6b3f33ee2f9eab0e305330eedff55871f9f0fc91bcce7c9ef1ef9116c8bb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770992fab795191068dbb685",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "面对我的光芒，\r\n就连冬眠的熊跟青蛙都会醒过来！\r\n没办法睡过整个新年了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7f46b94fcfbfa29152c38066b7047fc961a5a70bcd797afbb4446c593d96517",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a552d62fc51de9a9f9aee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈──哈哈哈哈！\r\n新・快乐霸王来咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b9041ab50c74913b7a2e99af96e8ee63918e7a7229d4764b0ba8d4c95c5174",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4eef6f505575e0be88983e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "金丝缎的装饰很美对吧？\r\n我发出的光芒也毫不逊色呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5a8104e38b83e24f9455bed250ff72e984bfaf0b4d2ff3a3347328dc33aeca3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf03b5d19bf46537cb3628d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识一下\r\n我的光辉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4769777bff1ac3c363ba1c6c881015f3bc60bb9eb351eebb44cd84078e856455",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a481efe2e26bbd24b75d37c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba7776c7f432b141e5a619b9f8e42077ad110b65fd916413b0b5d7b49ddc152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f7ded3452fbea7e0e3b22fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，今天也来走在\r\n胜利之道上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74e35291e33fd2e89b239cf007a92823b1b159e87ebe264294aff6ebd6c95ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67530f9a57e9d6b26d83d5f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想让我\r\n发出什么样的光芒呢？\r\n没关系，尽管说吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0775c997069be050d74da2cb3a27cd8a0c3a234f6ba401e043a10d1e4f5a9ae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a737ba149d72c1a72cc2795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待你安排一个\r\n配得上「霸王」的训练哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82270c0789f07353b004ac2a710302b032a1812f37d778b7fd1502f8bf9c65b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2fa26b6b1a444ef34b41865",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通往「世纪末霸王」之路\r\n仍然险峻又漫长。\r\n然而，我没有停下脚步的意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed2329a9fecc556003dd4853ffcfffe55040dafc9332338dfe0cf2f376734b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c4ddbda5ed1b79845a95f4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次前进都会遇到高墙阻挡在前……\r\n但我会统统跨越过去的。\r\n因为我可是「霸王」呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a40280781ccf1daca130b710b9ff5a99536f60664b2de3a442b0aded7457751",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6dfc18da4d3313d695e4254",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「霸王」永远都要与孤独相伴……\r\n因此你的存在更是显得重要。\r\n你明白吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b22387b9145272d96b986ed87f58fe2e21c9558179c127487dd8c8ed1402e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a71e978f0e4b22f7f11798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有妥协的意思。\r\n我会随时全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d020544082e8f5c70f3d93c7f8f7eed4bb28600af51b7f7bb94ca760c827192a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd0da195b548843372599c10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，喜气洋洋！华丽耀眼！\r\n拿出干劲上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d8a6864bbeb0e3ca5baee7af95d63cc4b4080de00e9f842e3c83d3f41a4e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0d8799adaef0c1d7cdd48ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望能在心中带着新年的气势，\r\n有力地进行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6843136454a254fadbeb010610e1d3f3e955cde224e17c4e6292924033ebb603",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f794d0e6d15f08b7c03aaa2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔我啊！\r\n要变得比富士山更高更雄伟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32b1aca66dcef17ebe5f0f873f072e9dd0c55cf39ce0087f80d446d8a7ec2362",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2c7f4b586057952ff8c3e35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，朋友啊！这真是个喜气洋洋的\r\n最佳训练日呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "539cd37ae5c9670d31ecf328d5d3624d89bb82222fd802e5ebd1dd3731f79a46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f93357df68d7c724a12ba136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我发出的金色光芒……！\r\n就是给你这亲爱之人的新年大礼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6e17f5a5deed37b7532ba45180ccb953408e32649587b27762f969bbf14689",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2be0bb6876d52a56c6395057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，告诉你我新年第一天的\r\n新年新希望写了什么吧！\r\n就是「跟训练员一起获胜！」！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e3523c8d38a857fefdcbbdca762c65e889ee5a22193bcc1439c23e3e858bc37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257c5dba4cd951143d6a6b1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，我们上吧，训练员！\r\n全日本都在等着我们！\r\n我们必须化为太阳照耀众人……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d507d3c30520d11575a8cd8272c4fef44a695c9c114dcce461bbc224581829d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e41fde9198c7cf2447bdc6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之所以能维持「霸王」地位，或许是托你的福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ccdac3f2dacc0d090fbb16b6344c14b63d5ec57d3ac8bcbd4e3bd1c8ea4606c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67400150bba3c9546fc2edc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常伴「霸王」左右一事，你可以感到骄傲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e6c4ad8ff3d714041b6c829d4b1802b4683981abe1f89a772cc38512befcbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597b20fcc5170f8c36379113",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新春公演的配角训练员奖……颁给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1ee6f4b9952f74f47fc9c2baa0406986b7653e3972f95fa5f1b41281f01e74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418809a2a63d6b5a11233e1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯！办了场出色的新春公演！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad9c9f972960119b909b82f4d99a1cd46bedf2de21974c202a88a197cc06979e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f40f276e9816ea2f468945b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既强悍！又优美！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ece43f4bb68ffd99cdacb2d63778ce7740048e12a7332130de69a875839221d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af4de1f8a89c89ccd34e024e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会更加闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb60ae8cdd41b6ecf02510fed9fc3bf4b712e7035d0060f082d28191c3ff370b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3d597d5fa681486aad6175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错，好歌剧就是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "113dd1b81d62d0c23eb06252f0e636311e87c73a9cdc593c87cd219709a5163f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eebd8d5f0698b2c5da5b128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！\r\n崭露与「霸王」相衬的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9f8e21ec2b3c21e872a985b3661e701fc785b22ed56bcf121725a3c710fb4c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b714ed7be3d1f1a7511ba5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有我在身边就是无敌的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60757436a4aa35f9f0f508081194131824b25042c6be9c1bcfab621830c086a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65a11af654ee7656f7d59244",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拥有「霸王」的帮助，感觉很可靠吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf810e66a636b8890d1eea7c42cf5a457b42a4cf1cf6742adede0b8d6f3c2f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48f387cd0bdb7c28c72e95c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种才能的可塑性，连年糕都会嫉妒我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "762bfa883f29beff9b87c180e785b022672abafdb2f3d0756dcfde7bacf5652e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e21715aff8f5507c640a8b48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的才能盛开……！\r\n彷佛红梅白梅……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "622aa8de79369b6b2dc78c2c09907bdcf205530e37b11fd76a8a220c3491ef9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2718b77453dd10826acdbabb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迎春──尽管庆祝吧！\r\n有了我就等于好运上门！",
      "source_fingerprint": "158bc415271d2facaeb4989e6e428acf7fc09ef23247117548783c41a6899fb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe22379a5dfa2a6f1ec86fa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，我是好歌剧！\r\n光是存在就充满喜气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c143f20b386b9f58f6a360f0d25741d6721a5501fa38eb99fffa4fa8897450",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1015",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40bd67d4ab93dd66c0431f68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要狩尽一切猎物……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f49d3121f1cec7632d911615e09042a9145677fc7d69999b27d294718de55a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24ea0c082269cb9e642d607",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打从一开始你就是个难缠的家伙。\r\n……某种程度上，\r\n也算是值得欣赏的意志力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f544eb0ce1b9b8776e5885d6496af93881f054512b660432202dff9bee3fb435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e053803e2644ea142ed995e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b986ab40e3b0d7b1548e828",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…帰ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4ce6668376685d8d6d22290a11293dfb1889b4e4d0ef4bacd6f72c379445836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e784cb4db6fbeec81f398bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "归根究底也是你自己硬要参与的。\r\n──可别逃啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3283023a9926270ef10cbc6f7d882d8ee4566b02fd192f2a6da8bf891b94f868",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:626a175cb902de0eeede767d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我不懂你为什么能这么拼命……\r\n但就随你高兴吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc4fbcf0e207196a5a5c45987621924771e34f4f87843c9a6b04d9472a356e68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:766de77e317e9d3b9291f6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说来到了新的一年，\r\n但要做的事情还是一样的。\r\n──那就是备战，仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2fa355c9f6f7b7c8693077b50dadaa8f7951ae026f6e46d0ec0e927abdcf6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bce14b6277e606bfa0ab6c95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不知道鞋柜可以不可以上锁。\r\n实在没料到打开时，\r\n会掉出那么多的东西来……",
      "source_fingerprint": "70649ce320be8b1401ffefd5805aceda364df47afd2aeb980941d4df2222b456",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac878872b3ac594761328a3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……来帮我处理掉巧克力吧。\r\n因为其他人今天好像都很忙啊……\r\n──我需要你的帮忙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc8c45ab6a3f26a105cf2f2a094134b3febfa4eb81c86c5c24303a0f1018e7f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9fc4a11bba18b363077bfec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听到竹叶摩擦的声音……\r\n自然就会觉得凉爽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014891850454dd37797fdcfb2cc792a9146edd0e8282940737ed73cf3a231db9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27eb761418974e874293a4fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节的变装……\r\n让我分不出谁是谁了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b84b98a39de48310f9ada168255bbd8919a9ed6a23b1760592b3a593635a00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d95982522ffcced5b9f89e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "普通的玻璃珠都能变得异常耀眼……\r\n圣诞树的魔力，是吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a2fa4b0eb7401ba4a54ad68c52d9625f8aabbb67547d50a59d51a9266cbbcd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16b7d81304e834c2b4c0c670",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去充满圣诞装饰的街上跑跑，\r\n就当作是训练……\r\n有看起来不错的店家也可以去逛逛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e22cf7334b2bfc185deceefca937e80ef3578d9a61199b0128c7bfa111b18614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c07602d0e769991c4980941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b08e36ae7c8d10985365faba68d5e42b1b0afe40414722390933e01ce76046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adb68a29c1ebe2efb41cdc60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年底了。\r\n在被大姐念叨之前先开始打扫好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a05e334af090cd9bdd8cd82cf0d39b251f6da99374935048a1e57682d7f1d336",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2379eaaa296cabfb4d9ee807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……生日就是一个阶段，\r\n也刚好能借此想想，\r\n自己今后的路要怎么走。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c93b61b42a4ada5d1c981675b63cbbfacdbf07ac949593362f796c00425babe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91ac2f5dca3c1ae4a971f068",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "过了一个生日，\r\n也变得比较可靠了吗？\r\n身为我的签约训练员就该是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90d601ee5a0824fec5c912c745152b06afeedcfa7f366eb1543602725a45c57f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ce7fe8eb9282ad6c6cacf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的生日啊……\r\n已经流逝的时间是无法挽回的。\r\n希望新的一年也能没有遗憾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41bc9593b87ac170e0e146ef11f9ad71855d6eb853d60eb6542acf75d1e8b0c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4e2978e5a75592dae299c78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一下吵什么生日派对，\r\n一下又吵生日蛋糕的，真受不了……\r\n──暂时先让我躲一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8d781c745a4aeb4f5faaa1f9aa0b32ea3f2ced63719744b383aa5d6ea09397",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:492540394be7282d42cc4797",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新的公告了。\r\n……要不要确认一下内容？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db8326bdcca0927aba5a7436eab87ef67f0f0e4773144a1263ed8da44203440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "10015"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
